# A Day at Home: a showcase of the indoor round's features (docs/VIDEO_GENERATION.md, "Rooms and houses"). Pip and Nova's house - a living room and a kitchen, a bedroom
# upstairs - from a sunny morning, through an afternoon of rain, to a power cut by candlelight and bed.
# The house faces the camera (its front wall towards -z); the living room is on the left (pbrt x 2.1), the kitchen on the right (pbrt x -2.5), the bedroom over the living room.
film    a-day-at-home
name    A Day at Home
about   Pip and Nova's day in: sun on the floor in the morning, rain on the windows in the afternoon, and a power cut at bedtime.
scene   film_assets/stage/set.pbrt
length  64
tags    cartoon, indoors, showcase

toon     bands 3  lines 2
sky      9:00 21:30  south 0
exposure auto
weather  rain 0.8 from 22 to 40

house    home at 0 0 rooms living kitchen upstairs bedroom  style cosy
walls    home.living wallpaper stripes colour 0.82 0.74 0.6 colour 0.7 0.6 0.48
floor    home.kitchen checks
walls    home.kitchen paint 0.85 0.88 0.8
walls    home.bedroom wallpaper roses colour 0.86 0.8 0.82
furnish  home.living aquarium candles mirror
furnish  home.bedroom fairy
clutter  home.kitchen tidy
clutter  home.living messy grows 14 36
curtains home.living open
curtains home.living blowing at 20
curtains home.living closed at 44
door     home.living to home.kitchen open 6 close 30 open 40
switch   home.living on 38
switch   home.kitchen on 38
powercut 46 until 54

cast pip   at 0.9 0 0.3  facing 90
cast nova  at -3.4 0 -1.2  facing 0
sit      pip on sofa at 1 until 18
say      pip 4 "What a lovely morning."
open     nova fridge at 3
say      nova 7 "Who ate all the cheese?"
lookout  nova window 1 at 24 until 34
say      nova 27 "It's pouring!"
lie      pip on sofa at 30 until 44
sit      pip on armchair at 45 until 64
say      pip 47 "The lights!"
lean     nova on counter at 44 until 64
say      nova 50 "Candles, then."

shot 0 Morning
  key   1.4 1.7 -1.75   2.1 0.7 1.2   60
  key   1.5 1.6 -1.65   2.1 0.7 1.3   56
shot 9 The kitchen
  key   -1.6 1.5 -1.6   -3.4 1.0 1.0   54
shot 16 The house
  key   0 3.4 -9   0 2.0 0   44
  cutaway
shot 22 Rain
  peek home.kitchen
shot 28 In the rain
  peek home.living
shot 36 Evening
  key   1.4 1.7 -1.75   2.1 0.7 1.2   60
shot 46 Power cut
  key   2.2 1.35 0.6   2.5 0.7 -1.7   56
shot 56 Good night
  key   0 3.6 -9   0 2.2 0   40
  cutaway
